import hashlib,json,pathlib,runpy
H=pathlib.Path(__file__).resolve().parent;P='additional_operad_skills_remaining';runpy.run_path(str(H/(P+'_synthesis04.py')));fs=json.loads((H/(P+'_preparation.json')).read_text())['files'];p=H/(P+'.json');r=json.loads(p.read_text())
def e(i,a,b):return {'path':fs[i]['path'],'sha256':fs[i]['sha256'],'lines':[a,b]}
def f(num,title,body,ev,action,validation='Full source-body review; retained workflow not executed.',severity='medium'):return {'id':f'OPSKILL-F{num:03}','severity':severity,'title':title,'finding':body,'evidence':ev,'recommended_action':action,'validation':validation}
rows=[
f(29,'Signal heuristics substitute repetition and syntax for substantive validation','The signal table says ten identical template instantiations validate the template, min-size checks replace per-agent review, and calculate_X() distinguishes computed from fitted values. Repeated output and an executable function may reproduce the same invalid rule or fitted constant; these checks cannot establish semantic correctness or parameter provenance.',[e(104,68,70),e(104,165,173),e(104,197,208)],'Treat these as candidate-discovery/packaging signals only; preserve source-aware review and trace every fitted/imported parameter.'),
f(30,'Skill lifecycle stages are not the asserted cochain quotient','Raw Idea, Draft SKILL.md and Cross-Host Sync are named as C0,C1,C2 with d0,d1, then C1/im(d0) is called novel capability. No additive carriers, linear maps, zero composition or equivalence relation for that quotient is defined. Ordinary drafting followed by synchronization is generally nonzero, so sequential lifecycle arrows do not construct a cochain complex.',[e(105,34,47),e(105,144,158)],'Use a state-transition workflow description, or supply precise algebraic carriers/maps and prove d1*d0=0 before claiming a cochain quotient.'),
f(31,'Positive-optimum dual rule uses the wrong primal objective','The claimed precise LP rule requires <w,omega>=||omega||1, whereas minimizing ||omega-d0 alpha||1 requires equality with the supplied feasible residual norm. For omega=(1,1), d0 alpha=(alpha,0), alpha=1 and w=(0,1), optimum and dual value are 1 while the skill requires 2. It also never binds alpha through the stated equality.',[e(118,73,82)],'Bind primal feasibility, residual r=omega-d0 alpha, dual feasibility and equality <w,omega>=||r||1; evaluate w in the subgradient at r.','OPSKILL-CHECK-022 is an exact two-coordinate counterexample; no reviewer runtime run.','high'),
f(32,'Prerequisite gate labels path existence RAN and accepts directories as programs','The fixed table contains scripts, data and one directory without declared entry types. Any target directory receives RAN with null digest, including a directory occupying a required .py path. No interpreter, import or executable check occurs. This contradicts the advertised resolution of every mandatory script/interpreter and makes RAN misleading.',[e(120,35,43),e(121,49,84),e(121,113,129),e(122,79,92)],'Type each prerequisite; require regular files for scripts, hash directories through a manifest and use PRESENT/RESOLVED rather than RAN. Keep availability separate from execution.'),
f(33,'Incomparable mirror declarations evade completeness refusal','check_mirror_set refuses only named < actual_set. A declaration naming an obsolete extra host while omitting a real host is incomparable, so it passes despite missing required hosts. The same file correctly uses ungranted-set difference for agent licences, showing the intended safer pattern.',[e(121,167,200),e(121,339,348),e(122,100,166)],'Test actual_set-named for missing hosts and handle extras explicitly; prefer structured host declarations to prose/token heuristics.','OPSKILL-CHECK-023: {.agents,.grok} versus {.agents,.claude} evades strict-subset refusal.'),
f(34,'Agent capability audit ignores absent licence text and undeclared deployed agents','Licence parity skips comparisons if either parser returns None, scans only canonical agent names, and filters out hosts whose agents directory is absent. Removing a licence or adding a new deployed-only agent therefore escapes the advertised authority comparison. Fully absent deployed directories become VACUOUS, and the main receipt still becomes PASS if nothing is BLOCKED.',[e(121,279,325),e(121,344,354),e(121,370,384),e(122,267,278)],'Require an explicit valid licence per applicable agent, compare union inventories, and make missing expected deployments a refusal. Expose NOT_APPLICABLE/VACUOUS distinctly in aggregate status.','Source control-flow review; tests cover existing empty deployed directories but not missing licence or extra agent.','high'),
f(35,'Cross-host hashing normalizes binary bytes and can miss corruption','The tree walker applies CRLF-to-LF replacement to every non-cache file, regardless of type, before hashing. Distinct binary artifacts can compare equal. This is broader than the source guidance to normalize text while preserving binary bytes and cannot support byte-identical custody.',[e(103,16,19),e(120,55,64),e(121,221,232),e(122,181,203)],'Compare raw hashes for custody and binaries; if text equivalence is desired, declare encoding/type and record both raw and normalized digests.','OPSKILL-CHECK-024 preserves a distinct synthetic binary pair with identical normalized hash input.'),
f(36,'Hill threshold does not guarantee distributed reinforcement','A sum of signals followed by a Hill curve is not inherently a multisensor quorum. The declared parameters allow K=1/2,n=2,tau=1/2, for which one signal 1 gives H=4/5 and activates. Duplicate or correlated reports are also unconstrained; n and K have no positivity/finite guard. The final nonclaim still asserts distributed reinforcement and the reference calls it noise immunity.',[e(126,24,47),e(127,15,20)],'Require authenticated distinct sensors, state dependence assumptions, constrain K,n,tau and prove the single-sensor upper bound falls below threshold; keep the result a score policy.','OPSKILL-CHECK-025 is exact rational arithmetic for one admitted signal.'),
f(37,'Danger-gate description and residual diagnostic disagree with the stated predicate','The description requires both signals before acting, but Signal 2 alone produces DEFENSIVE_LOCKDOWN. The reference equates positive Phi/Gamma with non-descent, although a residual decreasing from 10 to 1 is still positive. These are materially different triggers.',[e(131,1,3),e(131,19,38),e(132,15,18)],'State the actual Boolean policy and define before/after comparable residuals; distinguish positive defect from failure of descent.','OPSKILL-CHECK-028 demonstrates positivity with strict descent; no detector implementation run.'),
f(38,'Coarse unresolved fraction is not an upper bound after denominator restriction','The dossier proposal calls 273/280 unmatched refs an upper bound before restricting to catalog_bindings. Restricting both numerator and denominator can raise or lower the unresolved proportion; dropping seven resolved out-of-scope refs gives 273/273.',[e(130,28,34),e(130,43,50)],'Label the coarse percentage unscoped/unknown and recompute the exact declared population before claiming bounds.','OPSKILL-CHECK-026 is subset arithmetic, not a replay of the actual dossier corpus.'),
f(39,'SVG sanitizer can silently convert intended text into elements','html.unescape decodes numeric references too; the mask protects only five named entities. Text &#60;g/&#62; becomes a g element while the document still parses, so mandatory XML parsing does not prevent this semantic change. Literal sentinel strings can also be substituted accidentally.',[e(124,65,97)],'Escape text at construction boundaries with a proper XML serializer; if converting named HTML entities, preserve numeric/XML escapes and avoid collision-prone sentinel substitution.','OPSKILL-CHECK-027 constructs two parseable SVGs with different text/element structure.'),
f(40,'Half-life model and deterministic deactivation implement different dynamics','The reference states exponential N(t)=N0 exp(-lambda t), but the protocol deactivates every unstimulated rule as soon as runs_idle reaches half_life_runs. A cohort vanishes at that cutoff rather than retaining half its initial population. The documents do not supply a randomized or weighted bridge.',[e(128,30,40),e(129,14,20)],'Name the implemented policy an idle timeout, or define decay weights/hazards and their half-life relationship; reevaluate mutations against clean and malicious controls.'),
f(41,'Four-lock certification lacks the measurable carriers it claims to exhaust','Blackrod documents mathematical severity certification, intentional-malice identification and all-edge-case/topological certification, but give no metric definitions, finite carrier, exhaustive algorithm or operational enforcement binding. Role names, fictional keys and incident signatures cannot establish those properties.',[e(108,99,106),e(109,53,61),e(110,94,107)],'Keep these as governance workflow labels until each lock names inputs, implemented predicates, source pins, authority/authentication boundary and bounded failure controls.')
]
