md=['# Operad skills audit — in progress','',f"Source commit `{r['source_commit']}`. **{r['full_source_read_count']}/{r['scope_count']} full bodies reviewed; {len(r['remaining_work'])} pending.** Each receipt includes exact source hash, complete ranges and individual limits. Mechanical scans receive no semantic credit.",'',f"Current synthesis: {len(r['claims'])} claims and {len(r['findings'])} findings. Twenty-eight independent bounded controls observed; one shell control could not start. Retained skill programs, providers and native owners were not executed. Source bytes are preserved.",'','Useful components include source custody, premise/scope transfer, exact finite factorization witnesses, negative-result records, typed-input checks and usage-aware retirement. These remain distinct from external checker implementation and measured effectiveness.','','Material defects include unsafe repair dispatch/rechecks (F019–F022), missing maintenance gates and post-failure mutations (F025–F028), the wrong LP primal/dual equality (F031), incomplete host/capability gates and binary-normalized custody (F032–F035), and unsupported quorum/diagnostic claims (F036–F041).','','The JSON retains complete evidence and pending scope. Historical tests are reviewed source, not fresh replay evidence.']
(H/(P+'.md')).write_text('\n'.join(md)+'\n');print(json.dumps({'full':r['full_source_read_count'],'findings':len(r['findings'])}))
